http://localhost:8081/realms/my-realm
```

In Keycloak:

1. Create realm: `my-realm`
2. Create client: `gateway-client`
3. Enable standard flow.
4. Set valid redirect URI:

```text
http://localhost:8080/login/oauth2/code/gateway-client
```

5. Set valid post logout redirect URI if using browser OIDC logout.
6. Add roles: `ADMIN`, `USER`
7. Assign roles to users.

